", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_1840524873122821_3055739933188055904_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=h0uQRG0HoU4Q7kNvwE7AVSz&_nc_oc=AdoaijA3ac69TsZ0p315NHK00izcB0vkfsztBj9XEAv3Y84IQDHw19y4qNqO-OMvcP4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6s4ZgdD7M1lbfOo8jZ0v0C6fO01JB_t13YbQMXf9VHnA&oe=6A0721F9"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "3474397939524850", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974494_3474397942858183_7325370313459975246_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RYCtmVo95l0Q7kNvwGpMgrd&_nc_oc=Adrz2nikC-ZJah9_qgG3QFOuQu60KE1tM1lSJrAbwbQ40oq9qaIedtyZ73Qg-auNYIc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7OtFfGcETOhIRxKyKFFC0z1Q6kiOrkQ4edSmyriaon_A&oe=6A0738CB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hard Drive Logo (6).png", "id": "1060475455596738", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984476_1060475458930071_8663595066419356644_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iUXJRxOpIv4Q7kNvwGDO2M3&_nc_oc=Adqun2H8Q_eGauU61MS7Q7yoJSLhIETBdldrvi8cfxAUTV7fSICHqlgA3hb6dNLz-k0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7qnXJLnZ0VBIByC_tnZ5iykI52sIxWSVvW17cgnlM2Mw&oe=6A07374E"}, "display_name": "Hard Drive", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# *Hard Drive* \n\nHard Drive is a fast-paced, multiplayer, competitive electro combat driving game. Players control sleek, neon-lit motorcycle looking vehicles, known as bykes, which leave behind a temporary solid trail of light as they move. Players must outmaneuver their opponents by creating a trails of light that they cannot avoid crashing into, while avoiding the trails left by other players.\n\n# _Current Features_\n- Non PvP Driving Park\n- 6 Player Combat Arena\n- Season Pass with Progression Rewards\n- Cosmetic Shop \n\n## More Coming Soon. . .", "short_description": "Electro Combat Driving "}]}, "devel